  "summary": "Malicious code in selfsigned-generator (npm)",
  "details": "Selfsigned-generator@1.0.0 is a trojanized certificate generator. Its bundled file sample/cert.pem is not a certificate but base64-encoded JavaScript that index.js decodes and executes via eval whenever the exported generateCertificates() function is called. The decoded payload fetches a remote script from hxxp://144[.]179[.]201[.]19/settings[.]php and pipes it into a detached python3/python process for execution, downloading and running arbitrary code on the installer's machine.",
